<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - May 2.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - May 2.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    92/93     99/100     UNQ     190/191</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	   98/99    103/105   193/195   210/213</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Singapore bunker quotes edged slightly up on Friday but fewer enquiries were seen when Japan is having holidays, traders said. Recent cargo strength could continue to boost bunker prices but shipowners were likely to cover only minimum requirements if offers remained firm, they said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
